<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40036" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίληπτ-ος</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιλήπτ-λαμπτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>caught</i> or <i>detected in</i> anything, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ᾑρέθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					406
				</span></i>
			: c.part., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίλαμπτος
				ἀφάσσουσα</span>
			<i>caught</i> in the act of feeling, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.69
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
				<i>culpable, censurable</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.348
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.4
				</span></i>
			, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Chr.</u>
				23
			</span></i>; of errors in metre, <i><span class="en">
				Heph.
				4.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>.
			<i>disabled</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδράποδον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hyp.
					<u>Ath.</u>
					15
				</span></i>
			 (unless in signf. <i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>); of a hen-partridge, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				613b18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>.
				<i>suffering from</i>
			<i>epilepsy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				3.16
			</span></i>:—<i><span class="en">
				D.
				25.80
			</span></i> puns on the two senses, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς
				ἐπιλήπτους</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φησὶν ἰᾶσθαι, αὐτὸς ὢν ἐ. πάσῃ
				πονηρίᾳ</span>; so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ὑπὸ πάθους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.798f
				</span></i>
			.</div>
